{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2021-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1619136000, "end_date": 1619827199, "month_true_total": 508, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:48:28 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "91193437", "author": {"steamid": "76561198123604884", "personaname": "HoshiKurama", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HoshiKurama/", "num_games_owned": 121, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 3111, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1576, "last_played": 1760224476, "avatar": "e87f5e350dbf7479202671a401f17a6878d246a5"}, "language": "english", "review": "It was pretty fun to play at first with my friends, but as more and more updates came out, I found the game stuttering more and more for it. It's gotten worse with each update, and now this game is unplayable as the entire game freezes twice, each freeze occurring for 1-2 seconds, and it happens every 10-ish seconds (There's no consistent time for it, just the time between the freezes that come in two is consistent. People who play with me say I will freeze in mid-air and it happens, so I don't know what to say.\nWould love to recommend this game and give it a 5/5 rating, but I have to give it a 0/5 rating until they can fix this issue. Nothing's changed about my setup, so my rating unfortunately will not change unless they can fix it\n\nEdit: Issue has been slowly resolved over time, so I can certainly give a thumbs up! Developer contacted me and we talked about the issue, so thumbs up for communication too!", "timestamp_created": 1619820313, "timestamp_updated": 1622780350, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1620282818, "developer_response": "Hello there. Please fresh install your graphic driver again and make sure the KB5001330 & KB5000842 is not installed in Windows.", "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91192748", "author": {"steamid": "76561198205804012", "personaname": "OHGODNO", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198205804012/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 28571, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12772, "last_played": 1773431430, "avatar": "af6a683a6b239c01e7d3c9ce9b67814286e42a81"}, "language": "english", "review": "play this game, like just play it, its that good, if you dont like the grind, play it anyway because the gameplay loop is so fun", "timestamp_created": 1619819296, "timestamp_updated": 1619819296, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91189082", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014638574", "personaname": "Yrdi", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/YardiThomas/", "num_games_owned": 352, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1740, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 406, "last_played": 1638308340, "avatar": "6cd1198969487244beaf9bcddf1a86074add75a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "good fun game for co-op.", "timestamp_created": 1619814273, "timestamp_updated": 1619814273, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91188743", "author": {"steamid": "765611980459